<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>アンダーグラウンド・ファーマー</title>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #090c14;
    color: #f3f5f8;
    font-family: "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Noto Sans JP", "Meiryo", sans-serif;
    padding: 8px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .app {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .dq-win {
    background: rgba(15, 22, 44, 0.96);
    border: 3px solid #f3f5f8;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #1b2a5a;
    padding: 10px;
  }
  .hud {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 4px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .nav-tabs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 5px;
  }
  button {
    background: #1c2b5e;
    color: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #f3f5f8;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 7px 5px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:active { background: #3650a8; }
  button.active { background: #e09f1f; color: #111; border-color: #fff; }
  button.small { padding: 4px 7px; font-size: 11px; }
  button.danger { background: #7f1d1d; border-color: #fca5a5; }
  button.good { background: #14532d; border-color: #86efac; }
  button.skill { background: #3b0764; border-color: #d8b4fe; }
  button.door-btn { background: #78350f; border-color: #fbbf24; color: #fef3c7; }
  button:disabled { opacity: 0.42; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .log-box {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #ffe082;
    min-height: 46px;
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 7px 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .sub { font-size: 11px; color: #b8c4e0; }
  .qty-ctrl { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; }
  .qty-num { min-width: 24px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 6px 0;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }
  .sub-tabs-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .sub-tabs-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .sub-tabs-5 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .status-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 6px;
    background: #0b1124; border: 1px solid rgba(143, 168, 232, 0.45);
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px;
  }
  .status-cell { background: rgba(28, 43, 94, 0.35); border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 7px; }
  .status-label { font-size: 10px; color: #9fb4e8; display: block; }
  .status-val { font-weight: bold; color: #fff; }
  .dungeon-stage {
    position: relative; background: #060913; border: 2px solid #8fa8e8;
    border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .dungeon-canvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 270px; }
  .minimap-box {
    position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; background: rgba(7, 11, 24, 0.92);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px; line-height: 0;
  }
  .dungeon-hud-bar {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 8px; background: #0c142c; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    font-size: 11px; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .dpad-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .facility-card { background: #0c142b; border: 2px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .quest-card { background: #0d1b38; border: 2px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .npc-card { background: #0e1836; border: 2px solid #60a5fa; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .enemy-card { background: #220b14; border: 2px solid #f43f5e; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .battle-heal-box { margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 7px; border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.22); }
  .tag-pill {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .bj-table {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #184e37 0%, #0d2b1e 85%);
    border: 2px solid #59b88a; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .hand-zone { margin: 6px 0 10px; }
  .hand-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .cards-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; min-height: 54px; align-items: center; }
  .playing-card {
    width: 40px; height: 56px; border-radius: 6px; background: #ffffff; color: #111827;
    border: 2px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 3px 4px;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1;
  }
  .playing-card.red { color: #dc2626; }
  .playing-card.back {
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #1d4ed8, #1d4ed8 5px, #1e3a8a 5px, #1e3a8a 10px);
    color: #fff; border-color: #93c5fd; justify-content: center; align-items: center; font-size: 16px;
  }
  .card-center { text-align: center; font-size: 15px; }
  .card-bot { text-align: right; font-size: 10px; }
  .bong-wrapper {
    position: relative; width: 100%; height: 640px; background: #120724;
    border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
  }
  .psychedelic-title {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff007f, #ffae00, #00ff88, #00d4ff, #b300ff, #ff007f);
    background-size: 300% 300%; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    animation: rainbowFlow 4s ease infinite; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.6));
  }
  @keyframes rainbowFlow {
    0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
    100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
  }
  .trip-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff007f 0%, #7928ca 50%, #00d4ff 100%);
    background-size: 200% 200%; animation: rainbowFlow 3s ease infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.6), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .trip-btn:active { transform: scale(0.96); }
  .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
  .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 10px; }
  .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,0,127,0.55); border-radius: 10px; }

  /* === Mini-game fullscreen fix: while PCゲーム tab is open === */
  body.bong-open { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  body.bong-open .app { max-width: none; height: 100dvh; gap: 0; }
  body.bong-open #topHud, body.bong-open .nav-tabs, body.bong-open #logBox { display: none !important; }
  body.bong-open #mainPanel {
    flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    border: none; border-radius: 0; padding: 6px; box-shadow: none;
  }
  body.bong-open #barBody { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  body.bong-open #barBody > .section-title { display: none; }
  body.bong-open .sub-tabs-4 { flex: 0 0 auto; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  body.bong-open #bong-host { flex: 1 1 auto !important; height: auto !important; min-height: 0; }
  body.bong-open #game-wrapper { height: 100% !important; max-height: none !important; max-width: none !important; border-radius: 0 !important; }

  /* === Title / opening screen === */
  body.title-open { overflow: hidden; }
  #titleScreenMain {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 3000;
    background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, #1b2a5a 0%, #0d1430 45%, #090c14 100%);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    font-family: "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Noto Sans JP", "Meiryo", sans-serif;
  }
  .title-scroll {
    flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y;
    width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 22px 14px 10px;
  }
  .title-badge {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: .12em;
    color: #ffe082; background: rgba(224, 159, 31, .16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 224, 130, .55); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px;
  }
  .title-logo {
    margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(96, 165, 250, .55), 0 2px 0 #1b2a5a;
  }
  .title-logo .accent { color: #86efac; }
  .title-catch { font-size: 13px; color: #ffe082; font-weight: bold; margin: 6px 0 14px; }
  .title-opening { text-align: left; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.9; color: #f3f5f8; }
  .title-opening p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .title-opening p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .title-howto { text-align: left; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .title-howto .row { align-items: flex-start; }
  .title-note { font-size: 11px; color: #b8c4e0; margin-top: 10px; text-align: left; }
  .title-startbar {
    flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 10px 14px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  }
  #startGameBtn, #continueGameBtn, #diaryStartBtn {
    width: 100%; padding: 16px 10px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: .06em;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f2b33d, #e09f1f); color: #111;
    border: 3px solid #fff; border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(224, 159, 31, .45);
  }
  #startGameBtn:active, #continueGameBtn:active, #diaryStartBtn:active { background: #c98412; }
  .title-startcap { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #b8c4e0; margin-top: 7px; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="title-open">
<div id="titleScreenMain">
  <div class="title-scroll">
    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <span class="title-badge">🌿 UNDERGROUND FARMER 🍺</span>
      <h1 class="title-logo">アンダーグラウンド<br><span class="accent">ファーマー</span></h1>
      <div class="title-catch">育てて、稼いで、潜る。――街の裏側で生き抜くRPG</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dq-win title-opening">
      <p>ここは、表の街の光が届かない裏通り。</p>
      <p>あなたは小さな自宅のプラントでハーブを育て、酒場で噂と依頼を集め、危ない3Dダンジョンへ潜って稼ぐ暮らしを始める。</p>
      <p>収穫物を客に売り、骨董品を換金し、武器と防具を揃えろ。レベルを上げて、より深く、より危ない場所へ。</p>
      <p>酒場のPCゲームで息抜きするのも忘れるな。さあ、裏の街での暮らしを始めよう。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dq-win title-howto" style="margin-top:8px;">
      <div class="section-title">あそびかた</div>
      <div class="row"><div>🌱 <strong>自宅</strong><br><span class="sub">プラントで栽培・収穫／休養・装備・倉庫</span></div></div>
      <div class="row"><div>🍺 <strong>酒場</strong><br><span class="sub">情報交換・依頼・BJ賭博・PCゲーム（ボングくんの大冒険）</span></div></div>
      <div class="row"><div>🏬 <strong>商店</strong><br><span class="sub">回復・持ち物の購入／骨董品の換金</span></div></div>
      <div class="row"><div>🗺️ <strong>出掛ける</strong><br><span class="sub">繁華街・町外れ・地下街の3Dダンジョン探索とバトル</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-note">※自動セーブ対応。「続きから」で最後に閉じた所から再開できます。栽培日誌のセーブがある場合は「栽培日記からはじめる」も選べます。</div>
  </div>
  <div class="title-startbar">
    <button id="diaryStartBtn" onclick="startFromDiaryOnTitle()" style="display:none; margin-bottom:8px;">📖 栽培日記からはじめる</button>
    <button id="continueGameBtn" onclick="continueGameFromTitle()" style="display:none; margin-bottom:8px;">▶ 続きから</button>
    <button id="startGameBtn" onclick="startGameFromTitle()">▶ ゲームスタート</button>
    <div class="title-startcap">「続きから」は自動セーブの再開 ／ ♪ 画面を一度タップするとタイトル曲が流れます</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="endingScreen" style="display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:3200; background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, #1e293b 0%, #020617 70%); overflow-y:auto; padding:28px 14px 44px;">
  <div style="max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;">
    <span class="title-badge">🌿 MAIN QUEST CLEAR 🍺</span>
    <h1 class="title-logo" style="font-size:34px; margin-top:10px;">デカい仕事、<br><span class="accent">完了。</span></h1>
    <div class="dq-win" style="text-align:left; margin-top:14px;">
      <p>倉庫番を買収し、ヤクザの倉庫の在庫をすべて持ち出した。</p>
      <p>小銭稼ぎの日々から始まった仕事は、ついに「デカい仕事」になった。</p>
      <p>この品と金があれば、裏の街でも大きく動ける。――だが、街の暮らしはまだ続く。</p>
      <div class="sub" id="endingStats" style="margin-top:8px;"></div>
    </div>
    <button onclick="closeEndingScreen()" style="margin-top:18px; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#22c55e,#15803d); color:#fff; border:1px solid #4ade80; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 34px; font-size:17px; font-weight:900; cursor:pointer;">▶ 遊び続ける</button>
    <div class="title-startcap" style="margin-top:8px;">エンディング後も自由に遊べます</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="app">
  <div class="dq-win hud" id="topHud"></div>
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button id="tab-home" onclick="switchTab('home')">自宅</button>
    <button id="tab-shop" onclick="switchTab('shop')">商店</button>
    <button id="tab-bar" onclick="switchTab('bar')">酒場</button>
    <button id="tab-outing" onclick="switchTab('outing')">出掛ける</button>
  </div>
  <div class="dq-win log-box" id="logBox">自宅にいる（テスト用HP: 999）。「出掛ける」から3Dダンジョンへ進める。</div>
  <div class="dq-win" id="mainPanel"></div>
</div>

